{
  "_about": "The lists of the home page as a store (docs/PICWISE_HOME_STORE_SPEC.md, section 5.11; picwise_surface.home_store): its banners, the kinds of the Recommended band, the six sections and their tiles, the thirteen departments, and the drawing of each word of the month's ten. A tile's 'query' is the words its search is made of (a kind's own name, in the number that names the kind itself: 'watch', 'boots', 'air purifier'); 'drawing' a file of assets/home/art/ (tools/draw_home_art.py). Every English word here is a visitor's reading: changed only on the owner's word. A banner or a department's destination left empty is not drawn: the owner decides it (the specification's 7.1). From 2026-11-27 (owner: «η σελίδα το homepage πρέπει να παρουσιάζει τις πιο διαδεδομένες κατηγορίες που μπορεί να ψάχνει ένας χρήστης», not what the catalogue holds now): seven banners and fourteen sections; a banner's 'kinds' are the kinds it may name, the most searched first ('word' as its title says it), 'lead' how many of the first of them the file's own title names; a kind with fewer than two products tonight is on no tile and in no banner's words (picwise_surface.home_store.MIN_PRODUCTS).",
